[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3798886905","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115342#issuecomment-3798886905","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115342","id":3798886905,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ibmn5","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T10:29:42Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T10:32:02Z","body":"It seems the cause is the use of NodeSeek. Using seek makes it impossible to identify loops, resulting in large delta (which is extracted as root motion) at loop boundaries. We may need a seek node that introduces a modulo operation capable of handling loops similar to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/57959, but I think a [proposal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals) is necessary.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3798886905/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3799096638","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115342#issuecomment-3799096638","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115342","id":3799096638,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7icZ0-","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T11:27:16Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T11:27:16Z","body":"Isn't timeseek being broken like that kind of a big issue? Or is there another way to set the animation time that I'm not aware of?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3799096638/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3799140388","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115342#issuecomment-3799140388","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115342","id":3799140388,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ickgk","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T11:39:48Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T11:39:48Z","body":"If there is no loop, it is functioning correctly. In other words, it is not broken, it simply does not support loops. Therefore, if loop support were added, I believe it would be considered an enhancement rather than a bug fix.\n\nThe use case requiring loops with seek is when the user wants complete control over the animation's progression. In cases where animation progression is handled by Transition, OneShot, and StateMachine, without Seek, this issue doesn't occur, so I assume it won't be raised up so often.\n\nI encountered this problem myself in that case a long time ago. The workaround available at the time was to avoid manual seeking only at the exact moment the animation loops, letting the AnimationTree handle the time progression reversal (by modulo) caused by the loop.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3799140388/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3799148518","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115342#issuecomment-3799148518","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115342","id":3799148518,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7icmfm","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T11:42:03Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T11:42:03Z","body":"I see, I understand better now, thank you.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3799148518/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]